            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Falao wamwitanaga Mose na Aloni na ku'v'awi'la ati', “Yagi mukamufumi'zye Mulungu winywe ki'taambo, ali'vi yi'v'e mwenu'mu mu Misili.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mose wasu'v'yaga ati', “Lyeni'li' li'kakowoleka. Ku'nguno ki'taambo i'cho ku'lamufumi'zye Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wiswe, ha mbele ya V'amisili, ki'li' igayi'li'zyo. V'amisili u'lu' v'aku'wone ku'li'fumya ki'taambo i'cho ki'li' igayi'li'zyo ha mbele yav'o, vihe, v'akasye v'aku'gu'me na mawe v'aku'wu'lage? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yi'li'ku'dima ku'ya musi'nzo gwa nsiku' idatu' mu ibalangu' ku'kamufumi'zye Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wiswe, ki'taambo ki'ti' i'vyo walagi'li'zyaga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
