          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Falao wayombaga, “Nku'muleku'li'la muye ku'kamufumi'zya Mulungu winywe ki'taambo kwenu'ko ku' ibalangu', ali'vi ku'du' muye ku'tali'. Gi'si' mundombele.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose wasu'v'yaga, “Nku'v'a u'lu' nawu'ka du' na ku'ku'leka henanha, nku'mulomba Gu'ku' Mulungu, igolo nsasi zyose zisini'ke ku' wako, ku' v'akumba v'ako na v'antu' v'ako. Ali'vi ku'du' wize u'v'ezye wu'yengani wa ku'kaana ku'v'aleku'li'la v'antu' ku'ya ku'kamufumi'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu ki'taambo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
